acc/clean-8 Will global high-bandwidth memory (HBM) shipments grow by approximately 50%-60% in calendar 2027, still falling short of demand, as the item projects? | Global HBM shipment growth and whether HBM supply remains short of demand in calendar 2027.
acc/clean-9 Will global semiconductor revenue reach roughly $975 billion in calendar 2026, including about $500 billion from AI chip sales, as Deloitte estimates? | Calendar 2026 global semiconductor industry revenue and the AI-chip portion of it, the aggregate that underpins demand for Nvidia's data center products.
acc/clean-10 Will NAND demand generated by Nvidia's CMX (Context Memory Storage) architecture, the storage tier built around its BlueField-4 DPU for long-context and agentic inference, exceed 100 million TB in calendar 2027, up from a projected 35 million TB in 2026? | The volume of NAND demand attributable to Nvidia's CMX architecture in calendar 2027, against the item's projection of more than 100 million TB (from 35 million TB in 2026), and whether memory makers' capacity additions keep pace with it.

